    "Name": "Neutron NT-5742r",
    "Details": "The Neutron NT-5742r is a common battlefield refit of the NT-5742 that drops the C.A.S.E. protection for another double heat sink, improving its performance in hotter climates. While some MechWarriors complained about the potential for an exploding Gauss Rifle spreading damage to the center torso, most accepted that being able to fire the full loadout more often is usually better for their survival.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Gauss</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
